# A turn that ends without a word of prose in it. The model ran its tool, said
# nothing after it, and what pi leaves on the pane is the tail of the turn
# before it, this turn's tool call and the thinking under it — a screen no rule
# can tell from the one next door, and the only screen here whose rows are not
# an answer to anything. The agent is still there afterwards, the way pi is:
# whoever is driving this scenario decides when it ends.
screen boot
sleep 50
screen working
sleep 50
screen wordless
sleep 600000
